invariant: INV-14
file: src/srv.c
catches: srv_auth_test
reason: a server takes a ticket_key_previous with ticket_key's bytes, which
  shows a key change that wrote one key twice, so the old key's tickets
  no longer open. test/srv_identity_tests.h's test_previous_ticket_key
  passes the same array and a copy of it, and requires CH_EINVAL for both
  (docs/decisions.md 220).

--- old
    return ticket_key_own(srv->ticket_key_previous, srv->cookie_key) &&
           !ct_memeq(srv->ticket_key_previous, srv->ticket_key, CH_SRV_TICKET_KEY_LEN);
--- new
    return ticket_key_own(srv->ticket_key_previous, srv->cookie_key);
